    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Ultra Disk is now available in&nbsp;North Central US.&nbsp;Azure Ultra Disks offer high throughput, high IOPS, and consistent low latency disk storage for Azure&nbsp;virtual machines (VMs).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/windows/disks-types#ultra-disk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about Azure Ultra Disks</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Ultra Disk is now available in North Central US. Azure Ultra Disks offer high throughput, high IOPS, and consistent low latency disk storage for Azure virtual machines (VMs).\n\nLearn more about Azure Ultra Disks ."
  },
